"""Owner-facing descriptions for the known-variant catalogue.

One description per CONDITION (trait), applied to every variant of that trait
by enrich_catalog.py. Matching: exact normalized trait first, then the first
matching prefix rule. Written for a general audience: what the condition is,
how it is inherited where established, and what a result means — hedged, never
alarmist. Sources: the primary veterinary genetics literature behind each OMIA
phene; descriptions are condition-level background, not clinical advice.
"""

